    <item>
      <title>ADC Young Guns 23 Visual Identity</title>
      <link>https://motionographer.com/news/adc-young-guns-23-visual-identity/</link>
      <description>Founded by the Art Directors Club in 1996 as a showcase of emerging creative talent, ADC Young Guns is a portfolio-based competition for creative professionals 30 years of age or under that has grown to become one of the most coveted accolades in the global creative community. Every year, the One Club for Creativity invites a past Young Guns winner to reimagine the creative direction. The YG23 branding was created by Khyati Trehan (YG19 Winner).</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://motionographer.com/news/adc-young-guns-23-visual-identity/</guid>
